    ∀ φ ∈ GlobalTheory.WeilM.schA D.host.F κ, ∀ φ' ∈ GlobalTheory.WeilM.schA D.host.F κ,
      (∀ w : (κ → AF D.host.F) × (κ → AF D.host.F), GlobalTheory.WeilM.thetaSum D.host.F (GlobalTheory.WeilM.schr ψ w φ) =
